<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns single secondary credit.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns single secondary credit.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the single credit auction in which it sought to inject 2.017 billion pesos into the secondary market.</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     MAX    MIN     AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>2.017  bln pesos 1 day    30.35  30.20   30.27    10   4</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907</p>
